+CORPUS: Prose-focused Wikipedia articles about wildlife, plants, landscapes, biology, and astronomy.
+ATTRIBUTION: Wikipedia contributors; each article links to its revision and contributor history.
+LICENSE: Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0, https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/ .
